generate|Production/causation is broad enough for ideas without a machine-only restriction. Workshop result and playground purpose translate faithfully; transitive object classes are examples rather than exhaustive rules.
legislative|Law-making distinguished from enforcement without a claim about a current jurisdiction. Civics context supports domain; no legal advice, official taxonomy or verified CEFR is allocated.
protection|Safety provided by a cover fits the noun and from complement. Equipment/dust translation is natural and specific; the definition does not assert absolute safety against every danger.
testing|Process checking rather than school test event is the noun boundary. One faulty light is kept in Vietnamese; negation and partitive one align, with no unsupported cause or defect fix.
withdraw|Money removal, participation withdrawal and retraction have distinct ordinal support. Irregular forms and from/direct-object constructions checked; Master overlap and financial identity remain unapproved proposals.
